  "details": "I don't know if this is a bug or if this is intentional, but groups stop letting you join them at 10,000 members. The \"Join This Group\" button is displayed, and when you click on it the \"Group Rules\" popup appears with it's join button, but when you click that button nothing happens. You don't actually join the group, and no matter how many times you repeat this it never lets you join.",
